# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Third-party specifications are NOT redistributed from this repo.
# tools/xisf-spec-to-md.py is ours and is committed; its output is a
# format-shifted copy of Pleiades Astrophoto's documentation and stays local.
/reference/*.md
/reference/*.html
!/reference/README.md

# Test corpora (large, and may carry observatory location metadata)
/test-data/

# cargo vendor output from the deps-greps lane, when run locally
/vendor/
/normal-graph.txt

# cargo-fuzz build output. The corpus and crash artifacts are deliberately NOT ignored:
# every crash the fuzzer finds is committed as a regression seed, and the replay step is
# what replays them on stable.
/fuzz/target/

# Machine-local notes, never committed
*.local.*
